I find nethack to be something of a waste of time.  I've played 5
or six games and have never seen level 2.  As fas as I'm concerned
the game is no fun.

On the other hand larn is a great game.  Even at the start most players
could get to see levels 2 or 3 within very few playings, completing
the game took a lot longer, but at least you could play for half
an hour before dying.  The disadavantage was that there was no real
incentive to complete the game at higher difficulty levels (anyone
done it at 8?)

I'd like nethack to have several levels which were easy, so that the
novice can get the hang of combat and using bits and pieces.  Monsters
which are good to eat would be helpful.  Larn used to ensure that
nothing really useful was every on the first couple of levels, in fact
useful objects were only created quite deep in the dungeon, the ones higher
up used to be useful only to get down far enough to get the good stuff.
